{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Stickman\u2019s Bistro \u2014 where the fries are cold and the animatronics are colder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Five Nights at Stickman</strong> is a 2D indie horror game inspired by the original FNAF formula. As the new night guard at a suspiciously understaffed stick-figure-themed restaurant, your job is simple: make it through the night without getting\u2026 <i>visited</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check the security cameras. Shut the doors. Conserve power. And whatever you do \u2014 don\u2019t let them in.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd26 Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd54 <strong>Classic FNAF-style gameplay</strong> \u2013 Survive 5 increasingly difficult nights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Custom Night mode</strong> \u2013 Set your own challenge and test your nerves </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcf9 <strong>Point-and-click survival</strong> \u2013 Monitor the building, manage your power, and stay alert</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc7b <strong>Retro 2D stickman horror vibe</strong> \u2013 Simple visuals, big scares</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you keep your cool? Or will Stickman claim another victim?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was made with Gdevelop 5!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3831510?t=1754094798","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3831510?t=1754094798","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831510/be713b33e9418b4be2e87ba035b6badb5f84e93d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754094798","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831510/be713b33e9418b4be2e87ba035b6bad